+# Bridge Verdict Option A — Live Delta Report (label-fallback deployed; residual queued-stall class documented)
+
+- **Cycle**: 2026-10-29 11:30 +08:00 (cron Job 477786, trace 692aafdc)
+- **Author**: zai-agent (Z.ai GLM autonomous session)
+- **Type**: report-only follow-up to WO #2344 / PR #2345 (verdict-stall tracker) — remediation-outcome verification + two new plane artifacts
